        ## ====================
        ## OFFBOARDING PROCESS WORKFLOW
        ## ====================

        **Phase 3: Offboarding (Separation & Clearance)**
        1. **Initiation (Employee):** Employee requests resignation with reasoning [OFF-018]
        2. **Tracking Resignation:** Employee tracks resignation request status [OFF-019]
        3. **Initiation (Manager/HR):** HR Manager initiates termination reviews based on warnings/performance [OFF-001]
        4. **Clearance Checklist:** HR Manager uses offboarding checklist for asset recovery [OFF-006]
        5. **Multi-Department Sign-off:** HR Manager obtains multi-department exit clearance sign-offs [OFF-010]
        6. **System Revocation:** System Admin revokes system and account access [OFF-007]
        7. **Final Settlement Trigger:** HR Manager triggers benefits termination and final pay calculation [OFF-013]

